<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Layout xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THE INVESTOR <-> INVESTING ENTITY RELATIONSHIP LAYOUT. Carries AccountId/ContactId plus
        the three new fields: Signing Order, Is Primary Contact, Is Required Signer.

        ⚠ REWORKED 2026-08-20 - NO RECORD TYPE ON THIS OBJECT. A live deployment validation
        against this org measured that `RecordType.SObjectType = AccountContactRelation` is
        rejected outright as a restricted picklist value - this object does not support custom
        Record Types on this org, full stop. `objects/AccountContactRelation/recordTypes/
        Investor_Investing_Entity.recordType-meta.xml` was deleted for the same reason. A
        SEPARATE, independent restriction was also measured: a custom Lightning Record Page
        (FlexiPage) targeting AccountContactRelation was rejected with "The object type you
        specified AccountContactRelation is invalid" - so
        `flexipages/Investor_Investing_Entity_Record_Page.flexipage-meta.xml` was deleted too.
        THIS LAYOUT ITSELF IS STILL VALID - `IsLayoutable: true` was confirmed via EntityDefinition
        for this object - only the record-type keying changed. See the compact layout and profile
        files for how assignment now works without a record type.

        AccountId AND ContactId ARE NOT OPTIONAL HERE. Both are database-required standard fields
        on this object (measured via live `sf sobject describe`: nillable=false, createable=true,
        updateable=false), so both appear with Required behavior - mirrors how
        layouts/Lead-Investor Onboarding Layout handles Lead.Status and how
        layouts/Contact-Investor Layout handles Contact.AccountId's required-ness. Neither field
        is exposed via fieldPermissions (updateable=false makes them ineligible for FLS grants,
        same reasoning as Contact-Investor Layout's own comment on AccountId).

        🔴 THIS FILE CANNOT ASSIGN ITSELF TO A PROFILE. Layout assignment lives in Profile metadata
        (<layoutAssignments>), and profiles are .forceignore'd in this repo. See the comment in
        profiles/DPEG-IR-SF-Minimum Access.profile-meta.xml for the metadata-format partial-profile
        deploy this requires, and for the no-record-type layoutAssignment shape used for this
        object (mirrors that same file's un-scoped `Contact-Contact Layout` entry).

        ACTIVITY IS NOT A LAYOUT SECTION IN LIGHTNING - normally delivered via the ACTIVITY PANEL
        on a Lightning record page, but AccountContactRelation cannot have a custom Lightning
        Record Page on this org (see above), so the LogACall/SendEmail/NewTask actions declared
        below in <platformActionList>/<quickActionList> are this object's only activity-composer
        surface - there is no sidebar activity panel to fall back on the way
        layouts/Contact-Investor Layout and layouts/Account-Investing Entity Layout have.

        ⚠ RelatedActivityList / RelatedHistoryList <relatedLists> REMOVED 2026-08-20 (deployment
        validation fix, carried over from the rework above but missed in that pass). Both were
        rejected by the org with "Related lists not allowed on this layout" - AccountContactRelation
        does not permit these two classic related lists at all, independent of the record-type and
        FlexiPage restrictions already documented above. The <platformActionList>/<quickActionList>
        blocks below (LogACall, SendEmail, NewTask) were NOT touched and remain this object's only
        activity-composer surface, per the paragraph above.
    -->
    <fullName>AccountContactRelation-Investor-Investing Entity Layout</fullName>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Information</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Required</behavior>
                <field>AccountId</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Required</behavior>
                <field>ContactId</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Signing_Order__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Is_Primary_Contact__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Is_Required_Signer__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Custom Links</label>
        <layoutColumns/>
        <layoutColumns/>
        <style>CustomLinks</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <platformActionList>
        <actionListContext>Record</actionListContext>
        <platformActionListItems>
            <actionName>LogACall</actionName>
            <actionType>QuickAction</actionType>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </platformActionListItems>
        <platformActionListItems>
            <actionName>SendEmail</actionName>
            <actionType>QuickAction</actionType>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </platformActionListItems>
        <platformActionListItems>
            <actionName>NewTask</actionName>
            <actionType>QuickAction</actionType>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </platformActionListItems>
    </platformActionList>
    <quickActionList>
        <quickActionListItems>
            <quickActionName>LogACall</quickActionName>
        </quickActionListItems>
        <quickActionListItems>
            <quickActionName>SendEmail</quickActionName>
        </quickActionListItems>
        <quickActionListItems>
            <quickActionName>NewTask</quickActionName>
        </quickActionListItems>
    </quickActionList>
    <showEmailCheckbox>false</showEmailCheckbox>
    <showHighlightsPanel>false</showHighlightsPanel>
    <showInteractionLogPanel>false</showInteractionLogPanel>
    <showRunAssignmentRulesCheckbox>false</showRunAssignmentRulesCheckbox>
    <showSubmitAndAttachButton>false</showSubmitAndAttachButton>
</Layout>
